<p class='text-lg leading-tight md:text-xl lg:text-2xl font-medium pt-2'>You are guaranteed to get an amazing network and learn how to pitch your company to tech leaders. After 16 weeks I was overwhelmed by how many new contacts I had that were willing to help. Having a large network really accelerates the early stages of your company.</p>
<div class='flex flex-wrap text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl pt-3 lg:pt-4 items-center md:pt-3.5'>
