<p class='text-sm md:text-base text-gray-700 mt-1 leading-tight opacity-90 md:mt-1.5'>Employee vacation saving platform</p>
<div class='mt-4 md:mt-6 border-t border-gray-300 pt-4 md:pt-5 grid grid-cols-11 gap-3 md:gap-4 lg:gap-5'>
