<p class='text-lg leading-tight md:text-xl lg:text-2xl font-medium pt-2'>If you want to launch a company, Founder Institute is the right place to be! I pivoted from my original idea, kept training and refining my pitch.</p>
<div class='flex flex-wrap text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl pt-3 lg:pt-4 items-center md:pt-3.5'>
