<p class='text-lg leading-tight md:text-xl lg:text-2xl font-medium pt-2'>I cannot thank FI and its mentors enough for helping me go from idea to launch and now a seed round! Their programs really push you to towards your goals. The mentors at FI were always available for help and support: from reviewing cap tables to strategizing about launch. Without FI it would have been difficult to scale!</p>
